The portable C in the scenario menu-items: what it is expected to show
otherwise than the original. A patch of harness/goldens/menu-items.txt, see
harness/goldens.py: a line with - is the golden's, a line with + is what is
expected in its place.
Deviation: 10, 12 of src/portable_c/DEVIATIONS.md
Why: the box of F10 names the program in its title and in its question, by a
name that is two letters shorter: the box is two cells narrower, a cell on
either side, and its shadow ends a cell further left. Quit of the Files menu
brings the same box. And beside the Info, with the panel on the right off, the
ends of the two lines of the banner show, which the original has no more
there: its EGA lines, chosen twice, has moved what DOS had shown off the top
of the screen, and the portable C is not taken through those two steps

